        <mxCell id="httpBody" value="the single network choke point&#10;&#10;* host allowlist -- 2 hosts, enforced post-redirect&#10;* semaphore(20) == pool max_connections&#10;* HTTP/2 -- verified live on both hosts&#10;* split timeouts: connect 5s / read 15s / write 5s / pool 5s&#10;* streamed download, 5 MB hard cap" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10.5;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#0D47A1;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="250" y="716" width="400" height="130" as="geometry" />
